/* ======================================================================
   POLITICAL LENS - PUNJAB
   The dashboard runs off MongoDB. This server does three jobs:

     1. Login / session      - no dashboard without a login (when enabled)
     2. /api/data            - the ready payload from political_lens (gzipped)
     3. public/ serving      - the dashboard's HTML/CSS/JS files

   Run it:  npm install  ->  npm start  ->  http://localhost:3000

   Where the data comes from:
     build_punjab_data.py  ->  political_lens.aggregates + political_lens.tweets
   Without a date range this server only reads - it does not recompute -
   so the page takes about as long as it takes to send the data.
   ====================================================================== */

